      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "text" : "Whew...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "text" : "Still, he won't eat anything unless it's Meat. But maybe he will eat fruit if it was cut so that it was easy to eat. Like, if it was blended into juice..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "text" : "Ah! Come to think of it, I heard they were making fruit juice somewhere. Now where was it... Payon Village, or Morocc?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "text" : "Morrison!! Eat some fruits!! You don't want to become a slobby fat pig when you grow up, do you?"
