      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "text" : "[Housewife Marianne]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Marianne",
      "text" : "But these days, he just won't eat fruits. His face is so dull because he refuses to eat healthy. He just wants to eat Meat. I need to find a way to feed him fruits or vegetables...."
